          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "This method returns direct connection path that represents the centre line",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "of the connector, without visual styling elements like arrowheads, stroke width,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "or fill polygons. The path follows the connector’s line type (straight, curved,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "or orthogonal) and routes through all midpoints.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "This is useful for:",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
